# Casa del Guardian (C5a, contract 47; C5b, contract 48), 9 x 7, interior. column = i, row = j. The Reserva's warden: he says so; with the GOLD DENTURES (`dentadura`, found in the
# Reserva's area 3) in the bag he takes them and gives the EMPUJE module (flag 91 = `mod_empuje`, flag 836 = the exchange is done: a disc). A glass case with nothing in it, shelves of old photographs, a table.
@map casa_guardian
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@flag empuje_given 836
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  object=bookshelf text=casa.photos interact=look
  f  object=vitrina text=guardian.case interact=look
  h  object=table
  i  npc=guardian id=warden face=SW script=warden
  j  object=candle_s
  k  tile=mat
@grid
  abbcbbcbb
  de.f...e.
  d........
  d..hi....
  d.j......
  d........
  d...kk...
@warp k -> ciudad_ambar spawn=guardian_door
# The warden: without the Gold Dentures he tells his story; with them he takes them (the key item leaves the bag) and gives the EMPUJE module (flag 91). A done exchange only repeats a last line.
@script warden npc
    npc_face_hero warden
    jf empuje_given after
    has_item dentadura 0
    jv 0 1 teeth
    say guardian.a
    end
  teeth:
    say guardian.b
    take_item dentadura 0
    sfx item
    setf mod_empuje
    say guardian.got
    say guardian.about
    say guardian.about2
    setf empuje_given
    end
  after:
    say guardian.after
@end
